OL,3,GNEWSADrones will not replace officers,
OL,4,Asays police chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers will not be replaced by
OL,7,Fdrones according to the person leading
OL,8,Fthe trial of the technology nationally.
OL,10,FIt comes as Norfolk Police announces it
OL,11,Fwill use the technology in a five-week
OL,12,Ftrial to respond to some 999 calls.
OL,14,FCivil liberties groups have raised
OL,15,Fconcerns about the data that will be
OL,16,Fcollected during the flights.
OL,18,FSupt Taryn Evans, who is running the
OL,19,Fproject for the National Police Chiefs'
OL,20,FCouncil (NPCC), said the airborne
OL,21,Fcamera equipment would be used "where
OL,22,Feyes in the sky will add value".
